<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Hap Seng 1996 net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Hap Seng 1996 net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    23.7	  vs	  19.7</p>
<p>    Net profit	     73.73	 vs	  61.23</p>
<p>    Net sales	     117.35	 vs	 504.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	100.01	 vs	  84.96</p>
<p>    Minorities    less    6.75	 vs  less   0.02</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)     13.5	  vs	  10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Hap Seng Consolidated Bhd is engaged in rubber and oil palm plantations. The previous year's results are for the 13 months to January 1, 1996.</p>
</text>
